      "file": "src/web/robot_api.cr",
      "note": "The reference is a table written by hand, so each entry can say what a builtin does in words a new robot writer understands: what to type, what comes back, and an example to copy. The groups put the verb first (Sense, Move, Shoot), because that's how a beginner thinks about it: “I want to look around.” Each entry is a `record`: a small bundle of named values.",
